### Payment API — coleção HTTP (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@idempotencyKey = demo-key-001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Criar PIX
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: local-demo-1

{
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "description": "Assinatura mensal",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "paymentMethod": "PIX"
}

### Replay idempotente (mesmo Idempotency-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "description": "Assinatura mensal",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "paymentMethod": "PIX"
}

### Criar CREDIT_CARD
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me

{
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "description": "Compra notebook",
  "amount": 3500.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### Listar com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment?cpf=52998224725&paymentMethod=PIX&page=1&limit=20
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me

### Buscar por ID
@paymentId = replace-with-uuid
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/{{paymentId}}
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me

### Atualizar description (PIX)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payment/{{paymentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me

{
  "description": "Assinatura mensal atualizada"
}

### Atualizar status (somente PIX — CREDIT_CARD retorna 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payment/{{paymentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-api-key-change-me

{
  "status": "PAID"
}
